          "text": "According to David B. Salmons (Petitioner), according to David B. Salmons (Petitioner), according to David B. Salmons (Petitioner), according to David B. Salmons (Petitioner), section\u202f61(a) of the Internal Revenue Code defines gross income to include all income from whatever source derived."
