          "text": "According to Mr. Salmons (respondent), according to Mr. Salmons (respondent), according to Mr. Salmons (respondent), according to Mr. Salmons (respondent), the IRS maintains that the entire amount of litigation proceeds, including amounts paid to a lawyer under a contingent\u2011fee agreement, is includable in the taxpayer\u2019s gross income."
