          "text": "According to David B. Salmons (Petitioner), according to David B. Salmons (Petitioner), according to David B. Salmons (Petitioner), according to David B. Salmons (Petitioner), the same principles that apply to ordinary lawsuits should also apply to class\u2011action lawsuits with respect to the taxation of litigation proceeds."
